{2}{[You see an old elf in a worn, tattered robe. He seems a bit annoyed at your presence.] What do you want of me? I did not choose to live on this island for its ambience. [He waves you off.] I chose it so I wouldn't have to entertain fools. Leave me be.}{[You see an old elf in a worn, tattered robe. He seems a bit annoyed at your presence.] What do you want of me? I did not choose to live on this island for its ambience. [He waves you off.] I chose it so I wouldn't have to entertain fools. Leave me be.}{}{2}{}{ }
