{142}{I am well aware of the whole Panarii tomfoolery, yes. When I emerged from my regenerative state, I traveled to the mainland. I suppose I thought I could somehow live among the world again ... after I spoke with that Mannox fellow, I knew I was deluding myself.}{I am well aware of the whole Panarii tomfoolery, yes. When I emerged from my regenerative state, I traveled to the mainland. I suppose I thought I could somehow live among the world again ... after I spoke with that Mannox fellow, I knew I was deluding myself.}{}{22}{}{lf3 1 }
