{196}{But he your son. Whut you do?}{}{-4}{na -800}{579}{ }
{197}{I don know. But I gotsa ta go.}{}{-4}{}{0}{lf14 1 }
{202}{I fear there is nothing I can do. I am old, tired. I do not believe I could stand up against my son now, even if I could find the heart to try.}{I fear there is nothing I can do. I am old, tired. I do not believe I could stand up against my son now, even if I could find the heart to try.}{}{28}{}{ }
{203}{How is it that he is still so powerful after all this time?}{}{5}{}{212}{ }
{204}{Well, something has to be done.}{}{5}{}{222}{ }
