{211}{E:}{}{5}{qu1051 2}{0}{ }
{212}{We do not know what life in the Void is like, if it can even be called life. Who knows what sources of power could be found on the other side?}{We do not know what life in the Void is like, if it can even be called life. Who knows what sources of power could be found on the other side?}{}{29}{}{ }
{213}{There must be some way to stop him.}{}{5}{}{222}{ }
{222}{I can think of only one possible strategy to defeat him, now. You must retrieve the Vendigroth device that was meant to destroy him.}{I can think of only one possible strategy to defeat him, now. You must retrieve the Vendigroth device that was meant to destroy him.}{}{30}{}{qu1051 1, ss 18, gf2089 1 }
