{351}{You're going to need to do something, now. [Tell him your story.]}{}{5}{gf1099 1, gf2000 0, lf7 0, na -800}{499}{lf7 1 }
{352}{You're going to need to do something, now. [Tell him your story.]}{}{5}{gf2000 1, lf7 0, na -800}{499}{lf7 1 }
{353}{Interesting. Well, I'm off to Vendigroth, then.}{}{5}{qu1051 2}{0}{qu1051 2, gf2089 1 }
{354}{I do not know, exactly. Those days are long past, and with them a better part of my memory, I am afraid. All I know is that at one point Vendigroth and its settlements spread out over that whole area now known as the Wastes. There was a bridge leading into the Vendigroth province, here. [He marks your map.]}{I do not know, exactly. Those days are long past, and with them a better part of my memory, I am afraid. All I know is that at one point Vendigroth and its settlements spread out over that whole area now known as the Wastes. There was a bridge leading into the Vendigroth province, here. [He marks your map.]}{}{44}{}{mm20, lf2 1 }
