{474}{That is unfortunate, to say the least. I suppose all that remains now is for you to be banished to the Void. Hopefully, you will be able to find another means to defeat him on the other side.}{That is unfortunate, to say the least. I suppose all that remains now is for you to be banished to the Void. Hopefully, you will be able to find another means to defeat him on the other side.}{}{57}{}{ }
