{489}{We have no choice in our responsibilities in this life, regardless of how it may appear. I can assure you, this is your task to shoulder.}{We have no choice in our responsibilities in this life, regardless of how it may appear. I can assure you, this is your task to shoulder.}{}{60}{}{ }
