{495}{Please forgive my impudence. Where may I find this device?}{}{5}{}{262}{lf12 0 }
{496}{With pleasure. I'm tired of you.}{}{5}{}{0}{re -5 }
{499}{Someone needs to do something about this situation, but I am too old, and I don't trust you. You are far too evil.}{Someone needs to do something about this situation, but I am too old, and I don't trust you. You are far too evil.}{}{62}{}{ }
