{529}{Watch yourself, sir! This is an opportunity for you to redeem yourself! I should not be surprised that someone of your ilk would scoff at such an opportunity.}{Watch yourself, madam! This is an opportunity for you to redeem yourself! I should not be surprised that someone of your ilk would scoff at such an opportunity.}{}{68}{}{ }
