{585}{The ruins of Vendigroth are lost to time within the vast desert created when Arronax called his destruction down upon them. I do not know what to tell you other than to go to the wastes to see what you may find.}{The ruins of Vendigroth are lost to time within the vast desert created when Arronax called his destruction down upon them. I do not know what to tell you other than to go to the wastes to see what you may find.}{}{84}{}{mm 20 }
