{613}{Ah, you must be referring to the prophecies. If one were superstitious, or gullible such as yourself, it would almost seem as if they were coming true. You do seem to be in the center of all of this, somehow.}{Ah, you must be referring to the prophecies. If one were superstitious, or gullible such as yourself, it would almost seem as if they were coming true. You do seem to be in the center of all of this, somehow.}{}{89}{}{ }
