{635}{KERGHAN was the only human member of the Elven Council. He persisted in developing the Necromantic arts after the Council had told him to stop. Ugly business, really. Stealing corpses, experimenting on them, bringing them back to life to kill them again.}{KERGHAN was the only human member of the Elven Council. He persisted in developing the Necromantic arts after the Council had told him to stop. Ugly business, really. Stealing corpses, experimenting on them, bringing them back to life to kill them again.}{}{92}{}{ru2113 }
