{641}{Golgoth's, I mean, GORGOTH'S is a simple tale, though disturbingly common in the Age of Legend. He was a mindless beast with an insatiable appetite. Had a liking for halflings, if I recall correctly. Bringing him low took quite a fierce battle, though a mindless one. We could think of nothing to do with him, so we banished him to the Void to keep him from wreaking any more havoc.}{Golgoth's, I mean, GORGOTH'S is a simple tale, though disturbingly common in the Age of Legend. He was a mindless beast with an insatiable appetite. Had a liking for halflings, if I recall correctly. Bringing him low took quite a fierce battle, though a mindless one. We could think of nothing to do with him, so we banished him to the Void to keep him from wreaking any more havoc.}{}{93}{}{ru2116 }
