{698}{I suppose you've never heard of a regenerative shell, eh? I'm not surprised, only the most powerful mages can conjure one up. I wish I'd never learned how, myself. I wouldn't have had a thousand years to ponder all my stupendous mistakes.}{I suppose you've never heard of a regenerative shell, eh? I'm not surprised, only the most powerful mages can conjure one up. I wish I'd never learned how, myself. I wouldn't have had a thousand years to ponder all my stupendous mistakes.}{}{104}{}{ }
{699}{Why would you say that? You saved the world from Arronax!}{}{5}{}{54}{ }
