{710}{[Tell him your story.]}{}{5}{gf2000 1,  na -800}{499}{lf7 1 }
{720}{His legendary courage failed him. When faced with certain defeat, he lost his mind and fled back to Kree. He had his army slaughter every man, woman and child in his desperation. I do not know what he hoped to accomplish by this. When I caught up with him, I was overcome by a bit of the madman myself. I banished him single handedly in my fury, which was not an easy thing to do, even then.}{His legendary courage failed him. When faced with certain defeat, he lost his mind and fled back to Kree. He had his army slaughter every man, woman and child in his desperation. I do not know what he hoped to accomplish by this. When I caught up with him, I was overcome by a bit of the madman myself. I banished him single handedly in my fury, which was not an easy thing to do, even then.}{}{106}{}{ }
